    {
      "id": "u_568bd6bf10a302c988c06e46_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Obsidian has a few reserved property names, which are treated differently in Trilium as well:",
      "sourceHash": "568bd6bf10a302c988c06e46627bb48fd77a64dad0a0132120d83d351c100835",
      "context": "Obsidian > Properties > Special properties",
      "contextHash": "6741ab4ce77d44aff070ae7a249e63530b22d2f124938e493470bc6911439cdb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7780d8da746142260fb9d64f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__, where every tag is turned into its own __TRILIUM_PH_1__label__TRILIUM_PH_2__ (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__ when __TRILIUM_PH_5__).",
      "sourceHash": "7780d8da746142260fb9d64f53d2ae9421f45534d1530a8d266236df3d1a9016",
      "context": "Obsidian > Properties > Special properties",
      "contextHash": "6741ab4ce77d44aff070ae7a249e63530b22d2f124938e493470bc6911439cdb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b001d3b31eedd7e28020fa49_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ are simply mapped to individual __TRILIUM_PH_1__ labels",
      "sourceHash": "b001d3b31eedd7e28020fa4977b4dfc733fe395e973fb36a5ac66337698c7c1a",
      "context": "Obsidian > Properties > Special properties",
      "contextHash": "6741ab4ce77d44aff070ae7a249e63530b22d2f124938e493470bc6911439cdb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6b1795e4031ab4c48d54778e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__, __TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__ are ignored.",
      "sourceHash": "6b1795e4031ab4c48d54778e2c6732448bf4db68dcff616044d9a26c5bb128d5",
      "context": "Obsidian > Properties > Special properties",
      "contextHash": "6741ab4ce77d44aff070ae7a249e63530b22d2f124938e493470bc6911439cdb",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Limitations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3feba2dbd0d28887b22a99884dc255c7ff2e43988d",
      "context": "Obsidian > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "1603434de813e28523fbdc55ce87100216a5a661d7f0e2f0a8ec9477b1291436",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_975bb96d320ff2f02e2dc36c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Comments (__TRILIUM_PH_0__ syntax) are simply stripped.",
      "sourceHash": "975bb96d320ff2f02e2dc36c27a764c54082f4aadf516b298aee66fff2424fe8",
      "context": "Obsidian > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "1603434de813e28523fbdc55ce87100216a5a661d7f0e2f0a8ec9477b1291436",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_94af23c1569d95328aadb083_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Obsidian __TRILIUM_PH_0__bases__TRILIUM_PH_1__ functionality is not preserved.",
      "sourceHash": "94af23c1569d95328aadb0834a88b6a497f8d4e340a70a0285c437ca275e16b7",
      "context": "Obsidian > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "1603434de813e28523fbdc55ce87100216a5a661d7f0e2f0a8ec9477b1291436",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d78dc0dc032e4c9d41cb3d44_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The closest equivalent in Trilium would be __TRILIUM_PH_0__Collections__TRILIUM_PH_1__ but they work fundamentally different because bases don't store particular notes, they act more like a __TRILIUM_PH_2__Saved Search__TRILIUM_PH_3__ with a collection view.",
      "sourceHash": "d78dc0dc032e4c9d41cb3d448c7108d05b6c36dd1c05a76a0b3f9b0ec8a5ef7f",
      "context": "Obsidian > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "1603434de813e28523fbdc55ce87100216a5a661d7f0e2f0a8ec9477b1291436",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_08ba54146cee7068ad1c5823_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Since the base query format is quite different to Trilium's __TRILIUM_PH_0__Search__TRILIUM_PH_1__ syntax, it's unlikely they'll ever be supported.",
      "sourceHash": "08ba54146cee7068ad1c582319f0db7188beb988cc65d8df7ebc8822ca689c24",
      "context": "Obsidian > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "1603434de813e28523fbdc55ce87100216a5a661d7f0e2f0a8ec9477b1291436",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e26d8fd70c5c5b96445e4483_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "When a base is encountered, it is simply ignored from the import.",
      "sourceHash": "e26d8fd70c5c5b96445e44837731759adf46df1d12cc453497de5400378ebf64",
      "context": "Obsidian > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "1603434de813e28523fbdc55ce87100216a5a661d7f0e2f0a8ec9477b1291436",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_98f0cf5c1518c3f7ef698d46_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Canvases are not imported.",
      "sourceHash": "98f0cf5c1518c3f7ef698d469857c98afaf5502ce57eff67a95a0540dce51f2d",
      "context": "Obsidian > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "1603434de813e28523fbdc55ce87100216a5a661d7f0e2f0a8ec9477b1291436",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0d30192c3b53d3b4b118343e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Theoretically they could map to either __TRILIUM_PH_0__Canvas__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or __TRILIUM_PH_2__Relation Map__TRILIUM_PH_3__ but they are too different to reconcile.",
      "sourceHash": "0d30192c3b53d3b4b118343eb26cf7f8165ae851187fed16f72eb4934ca2126d",
      "context": "Obsidian > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "1603434de813e28523fbdc55ce87100216a5a661d7f0e2f0a8ec9477b1291436",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_977e58f764ad67e14b36e6cb_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Links",
      "sourceHash": "977e58f764ad67e14b36e6cbd6dbc7aa8f0e7c1caa6e2f9f13475db9b739976a",
      "context": "Obsidian > Limitations",
